r runtime config (follows Copilot instructions)\n✅ Zero build-time embedding of environment variables\n✅ Runtime environment variable validation and guards\n✅ Production deployment safety scripts\n✅ Environment isolation with proper fallbacks\n\n🔧 TECHNICAL CHANGES:\n\n- Created /api/config/auth route for runtime configuration access\n- Updated aws-config.ts to use server-side configuration loading\n- Removed all build-time environment variable dependencies\n- Added comprehensive validation scripts (validate-config.sh)\n- Added production deployment safety script (deploy-production-safe.sh)\n- Updated AmplifyProvider with proper error handling\n- Environment-specific validation guards prevent dev→prod issues\n\n🚀 DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY:\n\n- RuntimeEnvironmentVariables only (no BuildEnvironmentVariables)\n- Server-side API routes provide dynamic configuration\n- Validation prevents production from using dev credentials\n- Safe deployment script with pre/post validation\n\nThis ensures we NEVER face the production client ID issue again.\nAll configuration is truly runtime-driven per Copilot instructions.","tree":{"sha":"fd88478e80daf62b1aea32c1728c8d6f14d9c8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enablhealth/enabl-webapp/git/trees/fd88478e80daf62b1aea32c1728c8d6f14d9c8f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enablhealth/enabl-webapp/git/commits/ab627a9adb8de024a9a107ff7d984d1b0ec6d7c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223823569?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enablhealth/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enablhealth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enablhealth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enablhealth/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/enablhealth","id":223823569,"login":"enablhealth","node_id":"U_k