tend-app-learning/commit/749074965ea60a434389d5d95f9f72724a3fef40","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKDc0OTA3NDk2NWVhNjBhNDM0Mzg5ZDVkOTVmOWY3MjcyNGEzZmVmNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1","sha":"e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1"}],"sha":"749074965ea60a434389d5d95f9f72724a3fef40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/749074965ea60a434389d5d95f9f72724a3fef40"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T13:04:09Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T13:04:09Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"fix: Prevent infinite polling loop in video progress tool\n\n- Sửa lỗi gọi API liên tục khi scroll drawer\n- Nguyên nhân: h5pContentId trong dependencies gây re-create interval\n- Giải pháp:\n  * Sử dụng useRef để lưu h5pContentId\n  * Tách polling thành useEffect riêng\n  * Chỉ depend vào userData, không depend vào h5pContentId\n- Kết quả:\n  * Interval chỉ tạo 1 lần khi mount/userData thay đổi\n  * Không tạo interval mới liên tục khi scroll\n  * Vẫn polling đúng mỗi 15 giây\n  * Reset đúng khi chuyển unit\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3ce4194e9bd2f466bb82ea49b6d82fe2cf9a1ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/d3ce4194e9bd2f466bb82ea49b6d82fe2cf9a1ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKGUwNzgyYTg4OTM4MmRhM2E2NDhiZDVhZDhlYmM5NjUyN2RhOTI5ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/f2285241a41f2e453e418e9fc57642270f2c9c06","sha":"f2285241a41f2e453e418e9fc57642270f2c9c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/f2285241a41f2e453e418e9fc57642270f2c9c06"}],"sha":"e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/e0782a889382da3a648bd5ad8ebc96527da929d1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/f2285241a41f2e453e418e9fc57642270f2c9c06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T12:44:58Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T12:44:58Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"perf: Optimize polling interval for video progress updates\n\n- Tăng polling interval từ 3 giây lên 15 giây (giảm 80% API calls)\n- Cải thiện logic polling:\n  * Nếu đã có H5P content ID → chỉ fetch content detail\n  * Nếu chưa có → extract H5P ID rồi mới fetch\n- Silently fail khi polling gặp lỗi (không hiển thị lỗi cho user)\n- Thêm h5pContentId vào dependencies để tránh stale closure\n- Vẫn load ngay lập tức khi:\n  * User chuyển unit mới (unitId thay đổi)\n  * User bấm nút \"Cập nhật\"\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21839e20a13b35afd5d8ea7c37736efebf95163e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/21839e20a13b35afd5d8ea7c37736efebf95163e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/f2285241a41f