an20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/ca66a76dd59e209673ecf9796ebfa6d4c206c061","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/ca66a76dd59e209673ecf9796ebfa6d4c206c061","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKGNhNjZhNzZkZDU5ZTIwOTY3M2VjZjk3OTZlYmZhNmQ0YzIwNmMwNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538","sha":"b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538"}],"sha":"ca66a76dd59e209673ecf9796ebfa6d4c206c061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/ca66a76dd59e209673ecf9796ebfa6d4c206c061"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:52:14Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:52:14Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"feat: Add tabs navigation and auto-refresh on unit change\n\nTính năng chính:\n- Thêm 3 tabs để chuyển đổi nhanh:\n  * \"Bài học hiện tại\": Chỉ hiển thị tiến độ unit đang xem\n  * \"Toàn bộ khóa học\": Chỉ hiển thị tổng hợp khóa học\n  * \"Xem tất cả\": Hiển thị CẢ HAI phần (mặc định)\n\n- Tự động cập nhật khi chuyển unit:\n  * Thêm unitId vào useEffect dependencies\n  * Reset state và fetch lại content detail khi unitId thay đổi\n  * Không cần đóng mở drawer nữa\n\n- Chế độ xem đầy đủ mặc định tab \"Xem tất cả\":\n  * activeTab initial state = ''all''\n  * Tự động chuyển sang tab \"Xem tất cả\" khi click \"Xem đầy đủ\"\n\n- Header \"Tiến độ toàn khóa học\":\n  * Gradient tím đẹp mắt giống header bài học hiện tại\n  * Icon Article để phân biệt\n  * Hiển thị tên khóa học\n\n- Import thêm:\n  * Tabs, Tab components từ Paragon\n  * Article icon\n  * sequenceId, unitId từ useParams\n\n- Styles:\n  * Tab navigation với underline effect\n  * Spacing hợp lý giữa 2 sections trong tab \"Xem tất cả\"\n  * Responsive design\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2cedf0377fe434098ed12d5ccf8932e7dc4ab62d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/2cedf0377fe434098ed12d5ccf8932e7dc4ab62d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKGI1NWFlOTI1NTkwZjU3NDJmZGMyYzM4MmE5YzVlZjdlNDRlYmU1Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8","sha":"aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8"}],"sha":"b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/b55ae925590f5742fdc2c382a9c5ef7e44ebe538"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:32:14Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:32:14Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"feat: Update refresh button to reload current unit progress\n\n- Nút \"Cập nhật tiến độ\" giờ cập nhật cả tiến độ bài học hiện tại\n- Trước đây chỉ cập nhật phần tổng hợp khóa học\n- Bây giờ refresh cả 2 phần:\n  * Tiến độ bài học hiện tại (current unit detail)\n  * Tổng hợp tiến độ khóa học (overall progress)\n- Thêm error handling riêng cho content detail refresh\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f3ea8469b17a969f82c1efaeea375fdb0f27988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/1f3ea8469b17a969f82c1efaeea375fdb0f27988"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKGFhZjc1NjBjMzEyMzdjMjc3MDY3NzYzMmY2ODgwMWRjMTEzZWQ2Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461","sha":"5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461"}],"sha":"aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/aaf7560c31237c2770677632f68801dc113ed6f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:30:16Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:30:16Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"refactor: Remove debug console logs from VideoProgressTool\n\n- Loại bỏ tất cả console.log statements dùng để debug\n- Giữ nguyên toàn bộ logic core (4 extraction methods, fetch fallback)\n- Production-ready code, clean và tối ưu\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1091419560b80642c345249149b140a3025c022b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/1091419560b80642c345249149b140a3025c022b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKDU4NDJiZDZjZGRjNDVjMGJlOTk4OTkxMmRjMDBmNzE4YmY2NmY0NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7","sha":"046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7"}],"sha":"5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/5842bd6cddc45c0be9989912dc00f718bf66f461"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:22:52Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:22:52Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"docs: Update MOOC API documentation with Content Detail endpoint\n\nAdded section 7: CONTENT DETAIL API\n- GET /content-detail/{user_id}/{course_id}/{content_id}\n- Returns detailed progress for a specific H5P content\n- Includes:\n  * content_info: title, library_id\n  * folder_info: folder_id, folder_name, total_contents_in_folder\n  * score: has_score, score, max_score, percentage, opened, finished, time_spent\n  * video_progress: has_progress, progress_percent, current_time, duration, status\n  * summary: is_completed, has_interaction, overall_progress\n\nUse cases:\n- Display unit-specific progress in VideoProgressTool\n- Track detailed learning analytics per content\n- Show real-time progress to students\n- Sync state between MOOC and H5P systems\n\nResponse example includes full field documentation and data types.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0d234be5132251dadb8fdee5cbb0c4e9a7591aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/a0d234be5132251dadb8fdee5cbb0c4e9a7591aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKDA0NmIyZDYxY2I5ZThjMGJjMDkxYWUxMmE0MmJmYTJjNWJmYjI1Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab","sha":"7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab"}],"sha":"046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/046b2d61cb9e8c0bc091ae12a42bfa2c5bfb25b7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:20:15Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:20:15Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"feat: Improve unit progress display with stat boxes\n\nVideo Progress:\n- Split into 2 boxes: Thời gian and Phần trăm\n- Thời gian: 8:18 / 8:30 (current/total)\n- Phần trăm: 97% (highlighted in purple)\n\nScore Progress:\n- Split into 2 boxes: Điểm số and Phần trăm\n- Điểm số: 4/5 (score/max_score)\n- Phần trăm: 80% (highlighted in purple)\n\nUI improvements:\n- 2-column grid layout for stat boxes\n- Gray background boxes with border\n- Uppercase labels with letter spacing\n- Bold values with highlight color for percentages\n- Better visual separation between metrics\n- Consistent spacing and alignment\n\nLabels updated:\n- \"Tiến độ video\" → \"Tiến độ xem video\"\n- \"Điểm bài tập\" → \"Điểm bài tập tương tác\"\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6950d46627d0bca708864f6bb4939196a8b4a9d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/6950d46627d0bca708864f6bb4939196a8b4a9d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKDc3MTJkOTJiYmJjMGUzMjY0MTY5NDE1ZThlN2ZlYzU0YjIxYjAwYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79","sha":"ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79"}],"sha":"7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/7712d92bbbc0e3264169415e8e7fec54b21b00ab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:18:09Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:18:09Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"fix: Add fetch fallback for cross-origin iframe H5P extraction\n\nProblem:\n- Frontend: http://apps.local.edly.io:2000\n- Iframe: http://local.edly.io:8000\n- Different domains/ports = Cross-Origin blocking\n- Cannot access iframe.contentDocument\n\nSolution:\n- Added fetchH5PFromURL() async function\n- Fetch iframe HTML directly when CORS blocks access\n- Parse HTML string to find H5P embed code\n- Two regex patterns:\n  1. <iframe src=\"...h5p.itp.vn...id=253...\">\n  2. h5p.itp.vn...id=253 (flexible pattern)\n\nChanges:\n- Made extractH5PContentId() async\n- Added await in useEffect timeout and interval\n- Call fetchH5PFromURL() when cross-origin error occurs\n- Log fetch process and HTML preview for debugging\n\nThis handles raw HTML H5P embeds in cross-origin iframes.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4df8a0a81cdb4480195faf7ad24ef05a5f8610c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/c4df8a0a81cdb4480195faf7ad24ef05a5f8610c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKGFkOThjMWQyYjY5ZTg3OGY5NDI1NTFlNDAyNWJlNzc1MjY0MTliNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c","sha":"fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c"}],"sha":"ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/ad98c1d2b69e878f942551e4025be77526419b79"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:15:27Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:15:27Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"feat: Improve H5P content ID extraction with 4 fallback methods\n\nMethod 1: querySelector with iframe[src*=''h5p'']\n- Standard DOM query for H5P iframes\n\nMethod 2: Loop through all iframes\n- Check each iframe''s src attribute\n- Log all iframe sources for debugging\n- Works when querySelector fails\n\nMethod 3: Regex search in HTML source\n- Pattern: <iframe src=\"...h5p...\" ...>\n- Extract URL from raw HTML string\n- Parse content ID from URL\n- Handles raw HTML embeds\n\nMethod 4: Pattern search for h5p...id=\n- Simple regex: /h5p[^>]*[?&]id=(\\d+)/\n- Flexible pattern matching\n- Last resort fallback\n\nDebug improvements:\n- Log results from each method\n- Show HTML preview (1000 chars)\n- Count ''h5p'' occurrences in HTML\n- List all IDs found in document\n- Log all iframe sources\n\nThis should handle raw HTML H5P embeds like:\n<iframe src=\"https://h5p.itp.vn/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?action=h5p_embed&id=253\">\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdec474baad5ae9c8436aa5e809545446c970fca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/bdec474baad5ae9c8436aa5e809545446c970fca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKGZiOGZjNTllMGY1ZTJmODI0OGNhMzJlOWNiOGM3ZTdiNjc4ZTA4NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/d48a6363089f17b696bddb1a4ea89c8f90453df5","sha":"d48a6363089f17b696bddb1a4ea89c8f90453df5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/d48a6363089f17b696bddb1a4ea89c8f90453df5"}],"sha":"fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/fb8fc59e0f5e2f8248ca32e9cb8c7e7b678e085c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/d48a6363089f17b696bddb1a4ea89c8f90453df5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:09:45Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-23T10:09:45Z","email":"luan@openedx.local","name":"Luan"},"message":"debug: Add detailed console logging for H5P content extraction\n\n- Log main iframe detection and src\n- Log iframe document access (same-origin vs cross-origin)\n- Log H5P iframe search results\n- Log body HTML length and preview when no H5P iframe found\n- Log all IDs found in HTML to help identify extraction issues\n- Log fetch content detail API calls and responses\n- Log interval checks and cleanup\n\nThis will help debug why H5P content is not being detected when raw HTML embed is used.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75e551f360c966b49d08e9c2