ard\n  * Show video progress with percentage, time, and status badge\n  * Show exercise score with points, percentage, and completion status\n  * Display overall progress percentage and folder information\n  * Beautiful gradient header with purple theme matching site design\n\n- Handle edge cases\n  * Loading state with spinner during API call\n  * \"No H5P content\" message when unit has no interactive content\n  * Status badges: completed (green), in-progress (yellow), not started (gray)\n\n- Responsive design\n  * Mobile-optimized layout with smaller fonts and spacing\n  * Touch-friendly progress bars and status indicators\n  * Maintains readability on small screens\n\n- Position in UI\n  * Placed after user header, before course summary stats\n  * Visible in both compact and full view modes\n  * Prominent placement with purple border to draw attention\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fac206a366a4a9c2dfe4c4af1cfeb994a1af7b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/fac206a366a4a9c2dfe4c4af1cfeb994a1af7b86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/3f3916f94851a7b63d6d3becfdcbefd290211708","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/3f3916f94851a7b63d6d3becfdcbefd290211708","node_id":"C_kwDOPYn23toAKDNmMzkxNmY5NDg1MWE3YjYzZDZkM2JlY2ZkY2JlZmQyOTAyMTE3MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commit/9980113ed6a40f0fea81c224a461a79690518d62","sha":"9980113ed6a40f0fea81c224a461a79690518d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vanluan20112003/frontend-app-learning/commits/9980113ed6a40f0fea81c224a461a79690518d62"}],"sha":"3f3916f94851a7b63d6d3becfdcbefd290211708","url":"https://api.github.