nts","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:33:05Z","email":"ashwinpulipati@gmail.com","name":"Ashwin-Pulipati"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T20:33:05Z","email":"ashwinpulipati@gmail.com","name":"Ashwin-Pulipati"},"message":"fix(build): restore green build on main\n\nThe Next.js build has been failing on main since the dependency bump\nin #39. Two independent causes:\n\n1. typescript was bumped to ^7. Next.js 16 rejects it outright:\n   \"TypeScript 7.0.2 does not provide the compiler API required by\n   Next.js.\" Pinned to ^6.0.3, the latest stable release Next supports.\n\n2. The recharts 3.10, react-day-picker 10 and react-resizable-panels 4\n   majors broke chart.tsx, calendar.tsx and resizable.tsx with 14 type\n   errors. All three are unused shadcn scaffolding: nothing in the app\n   imports them, verified by both path and export-name search. Removed\n   them, along with the three dependencies they were the sole consumers\n   of.\n\nNo behavior change: the deleted components were never rendered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"936476e82c5a047326f65d990a923108e60ccdff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ashwin-Pulipati/optipathway/git/trees/936476e82c5a047326f65d990a923108e60ccdff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ashwin-Pulipati/optipathway/git/commits/7c8dc9003a4255dc0a35732f928963a9a5523ef8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142634979?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashwin-Pulipati/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashwin-Pulipati/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashwin-Pulipati/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ashwin-Pulipati/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ashwin-Pulipati","id":142634979,"login":"Ashwin-Pulipati","no