ttps://api.github.com/users/hallya/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallya","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hallya/caviste_personnel/commits/3da4805090a30049f09868cee2fe9ff3c6a8a1a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-18T14:31:14Z","email":"coulterfeith@live.fr","name":"Lucien Dulac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-18T14:31:14Z","email":"coulterfeith@live.fr","name":"Lucien Dulac"},"message":"feat: implement modular architecture with app shell and feature modules\n\n- Add thin app shell for routing/auth/layout management\n- Implement independent feature modules (Cart, Notifications) with strict public APIs\n- Add route registry with lazy loading and preload capabilities\n- Create safe hooks for graceful fallbacks outside contexts\n- Maintain compatibility with existing context-based system\n- Add comprehensive test coverage (37 new tests)\n- Support inter-module communication via domain events\n- Include module registration and lifecycle management\n\nArchitecture allows for clean separation of concerns while preserving\nall existing functionality. Both old context system and new module\nsystem coexist seamlessly.","tree":{"sha":"3f43c106f5fc19f50bcd327ac1561de65d20096d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hallya/caviste_personnel/git/trees/3f43c106f5fc19f50bcd327ac1561de65d20096d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hallya/caviste_personnel/git/commits/3da4805090a30049f09868cee2fe9ff3c6a8a1a5","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f43c106f5fc19f50bcd327ac1561de65d20096d\nparent 0054b06a703d24b2081550ecf143dc08464f01ac\nauthor Lucien Dulac <coulterfeith@live.fr> 1755527474 +0200\ncommitter Lucien Dulac <coulterfeith@live.fr> 1755527474 +0200\n\nfeat: implement modular architecture with app shell and feature modules\n\n- Add thin app shell for routing/auth/layout management\n- Implement independent feature modules (Cart, Notifications) with strict public APIs\n- Add route re