:"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/73999bbf4a2c3e1bace16d3e44442f29fbf3b8f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-11T17:52:30Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-11T17:52:30Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"message":"refactor(architecture): Evolve to a Micro-Frontend Shell\n\nThis commit marks a fundamental architectural evolution, transforming the application from a monolithic SPA into a scalable Micro-Frontend \"Shell.\" This new architecture is designed to support independent team development and deployment, which is a critical pattern for large-scale applications.\n\nKey Architectural Changes:\n\n1.  **Shell Implementation:**\n    - The application is now configured as a \"Host\" using Vite and Module Federation. It is responsible for the main layout, core services (auth, state), and routing orchestration.\n\n2.  **Remote Consumption:**\n    - A new `PortfolioView` was created to dynamically load, render, and suspend a `PortfolioSummary` component that is served live from a separate, independently deployed \"Remote\" application (`remote-portfolio`).\n\n3.  **Seamless Integration:**\n    - The remote component is seamlessly integrated into the Shell''s navigation, routing, and user experience, appearing to the end-user as a single, cohesive application.\n\n4.  **Production-Grade Deployment:**\n    - The deployment strategy was upgraded to a multi-site model on Netlify. The remote application is configured with the necessary CORS headers (`_headers`) to allow the Shell to consume its assets securely across different domains.\n\nThis refactoring implements the practical foundation of a \"Strangler Fig\" pattern, demonstrating a robust, production-ready solution for incremental modernization and enabling true team autonomy.","tree":{"sha":"53742fc96bfad85a4d841bf2aa2d6a8e984ab65c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/trees/53742fc96bfad85a4d841bf2aa2d6a8e984ab65c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/commits/73999bbf4a2c3e1bace16d3e44442f29fbf3b8f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/73999bbf4a2c3e1bace16d3e44442f29fbf3b8f9","node_id":"C_kwDOPZijj9oAKDczOTk5YmJmNGEyYzNlMWJhY2UxNmQzZTQ0NDQyZjI5ZmJmM2I4Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27","sha":"79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27"}],"sha":"73999bbf4a2c3e1bace16d3e44442f29fbf3b8f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/73999bbf4a2c3e1bace16d3e44442f29fbf3b8f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T07:45:35Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-09T07:45:35Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"message":"fix(build): Resolve build errors and synchronize tests\n\n- Corrected multiple TypeScript errors that were preventing a successful production build.\n- Updated the unit testing suite (`market.spec.ts`) to align with the latest Pinia store architecture, including:\n  - Testing the correct state properties (`currentPageAssets` instead of `assets`).\n  - Calling the correct actions (`loadAssets` instead of `fetchAssets`).\n  - Removing tests for obsolete state and actions (`error`, `clearError`).\n  - Added a new, dedicated test case for the `searchAssets` action.\n- Removed the obsolete `GlobalErrorDisplay` component, as its functionality has been replaced by the PrimeVue Toast service.","tree":{"sha":"6fd33d2c7cbc719763aec678adae28eaf35d2dd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/trees/6fd33d2c7cbc719763aec678adae28eaf35d2dd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/commits/79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27","node_id":"C_kwDOPZijj9oAKDc5ZmEzMGI3ZDgzZWVlYzNiNTg1N2UzODQ1NmFkMzBlNTE1ZDBkMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942","sha":"ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942"}],"sha":"79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/79fa30b7d83eeec3b5857e38456ad30e515d0d27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-08T11:34:14Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-08T11:34:14Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"message":"feat(architecture): Implement server-side search and resilient state management\n\nThis commit introduces two major architectural upgrades, elevating the application to a fully-featured, enterprise-grade data exploration tool with a focus on scalability and resilience.\n\n1.  **Server-Side Search & Caching:**\n    - A debounced, server-side search functionality has been implemented. The API service now handles complex search queries, and the Pinia store intelligently manages the resulting state.\n    - The paginated data cache was enhanced to be search-aware, using a composite key (`query-page-rows`) and a robust cache invalidation strategy to ensure data consistency.\n\n2.  **Resilient & Transactional State:**\n    - The application''s error handling is now more specific, capable of distinguishing between generic network failures, CORS issues, and API rate-limit errors, providing clearer user feedback via the Toast service.\n    - A critical state rollback mechanism has been added to the data fetching action. If a pagination or search request fails, the store automatically reverts the UI state to its last known good state, preventing de-synchronization and ensuring a consistent user experience even under failure conditions.\n\nThese enhancements complete the implementation of a scalable, server-side data model and establish a resilient, transactional approach to state management, which are critical patterns for any professional application.","tree":{"sha":"fc8f92fa315bf57e5e45de6c366179d0cc8aa046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/trees/fc8f92fa315bf57e5e45de6c366179d0cc8aa046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/commits/ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942","node_id":"C_kwDOPZijj9oAKGFjNTM0NzM1YTQ0Mjk4MGU5NDNmNjI2YmYwMDM1NmU3MmZmOWQ5NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee","sha":"c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee"}],"sha":"ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/ac534735a442980e943f626bf00356e72ff9d942"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-08T07:32:07Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-08T07:32:07Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"message":"refactor(architecture): Implement server-side pagination and advanced caching\n\nThis commit fundamentally refactors the application''s data fetching and state management architecture to support a scalable, server-side pagination model. This ensures the application remains highly performant, even with massive datasets.\n\nKey Architectural Upgrades:\n\n1.  **Server-Side Data Model:**\n    - The API service layer was enhanced to handle paginated requests.\n    - The PrimeVue `<DataTable>` was reconfigured to `lazy` mode, delegating all data operations (paging) to the state layer.\n\n2.  **Intelligent State Management (Pinia):**\n    - The `market` store now manages the complete pagination lifecycle, including total record count and current page state.\n    - A sophisticated, multi-key caching system was implemented. The store now caches each page of data, keyed by both page number and page size, to eliminate redundant network requests.\n\n3.  **Enhanced User Experience:**\n    - The application now persists the user''s pagination state. When navigating away and back, the user is seamlessly returned to their previous position in the data table.\n    - The paginator UI is now fully synchronized with the global store, correctly reflecting the current state at all times.\n\nThis refactoring moves the application from a client-side data model to a true enterprise-grade, server-side pattern, ensuring long-term scalability and a superior user experience.","tree":{"sha":"0aabc2e5ace8db559f6c3fc5350c177c79f83789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/trees/0aabc2e5ace8db559f6c3fc5350c177c79f83789"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/commits/c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee","node_id":"C_kwDOPZijj9oAKGM5NTI3MjJjZjUwYjA5ODBlMzk5ODUyYmQ1Y2ViNGM1MDkxZTg2ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/ae142ad9fc6d83817d5bf9afb2e3fa8da8324a5a","sha":"ae142ad9fc6d83817d5bf9afb2e3fa8da8324a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/ae142ad9fc6d83817d5bf9afb2e3fa8da8324a5a"}],"sha":"c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/c952722cf50b0980e399852bd5ceb4c5091e86ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u