,"verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/7cb39cb35cff4f3c1483f982d35d0b1edf9eed8f","node_id":"C_kwDOPZijj9oAKDdjYjM5Y2IzNWNmZjRmM2MxNDgzZjk4MmQzNWQwYjFlZGY5ZWVkOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c","sha":"247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c"}],"sha":"7cb39cb35cff4f3c1483f982d35d0b1edf9eed8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/7cb39cb35cff4f3c1483f982d35d0b1edf9eed8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-06T18:11:22Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-06T18:11:22Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"message":"feat(app): Implement professional UI with PrimeVue and advanced features\n\nThis major commit refactors the entire application to fully leverage the PrimeVue component library and introduces several advanced architectural and user-experience features, elevating the project to a professional, production-grade standard.\n\nKey Upgrades:\n\n1.  **Full PrimeVue Integration:**\n    - Replaced all basic HTML elements with PrimeVue components (`Card`, `Button`, `InputText`, `Toolbar`, `Panel`, `DataTable`, etc.).\n    - The `DashboardView` was upgraded to use the powerful `<DataTable>` component, adding sorting and pagination.\n    - The `DetailView` now uses `<Panel>` and `<Card>` for a cleaner, more structured layout.\n    - Replaced custom CSS skeletons with the theme-aware `<Skeleton>` component.\n\n2.  **Advanced Architectural Patterns:**\n    - Implemented a robust, promise-based global confirmation service for sensitive actions like logout.\n    - Replaced the full-screen error display with a non-intrusive, global `Toast` notification system, fully integrated with PrimeVue''s ecosystem.\n    - Refactored formatting logic (`Intl.NumberFormat`) into a reusable `useFormatter` composable, cleaning up component templates.\n\n3.  **Enhanced User Experience & Features:**\n    - Implemented a full dark/light mode theme toggler. The application''s global styles (`base.css`) were updated to be theme-aware, ensuring a consistent look and feel.\n    - Added client-side charting to the `DetailView` using `Chart.js`, providing users with historical price data.\n    - The application shell (`App.vue`) was redesigned with `<Toolbar>` for a modern, professional layout.\n\nThis commit marks the transition of the application from a functional MVP to a feature-rich, architecturally sound, and visually polished product, demonstrating a deep integration with a professional component ecosystem.","tree":{"sha":"8a3e105d35ef3a24bf6dc5598bcb4cb4bc4a4979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/trees/8a3e105d35ef3a24bf6dc5598bcb4cb4bc4a4979"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/commits/247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c","node_id":"C_kwDOPZijj9oAKDI0N2Y3NDRiOTJkZTA1YTU3MTJiMTA0ZGIwNWI1ODFlYWYxNGI1NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb/market-watch/commit/536ed2ed5ff5ec62ce604957b9ade5d46ecc7ae0","sha":"536ed2ed5ff5ec62ce604957b9ade5d46ecc7ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/536ed2ed5ff5ec62ce604957b9ade5d46ecc7ae0"}],"sha":"247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/247f744b92de05a5712b104db05b581eaf14b54c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/commits/536ed2ed5ff5ec62ce604957b9ade5d46ecc7ae0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-05T13:44:24Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-05T13:44:24Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"message":"feat(auth): Implement full user authentication and session management\n\nThis commit introduces a complete, end-to-end user authentication system, establishing a secure foundation for the application.\n\nKey Architectural Changes:\n- **Firebase Integration:** Integrated Firebase Authentication as the auth provider, including a `LoginView` for user sign-in.\n\n- **Global Auth State:** Created a new Pinia store (`auth.ts`) to act as the single source of truth for the user''s session. The store manages `currentUser` and listens for real-time authentication state changes from Firebase.\n\n- **Secure Route Guards:** The `vue-router` is now protected by a navigation guard (`beforeEach`). This guard checks for authentication status before allowing access to protected routes, redirecting unauthenticated users to the login page.\n\n- **Dynamic UI:** The main application layout is now auth-aware. It conditionally displays user information and a logout button, providing a clear session state to the user.\n\nThis establishes a complete, secure, and scalable authentication pattern, enabling user-specific features and securing the application''s core functionality.","tree":{"sha":"9adbecac939b17252693729181b3adefc98c3520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/trees/9adbecac939b17252693729181b3adefc98c3520"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/commits/536ed2ed5ff5ec62ce604957b9ade5d46ecc7ae0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841