2177056cb2da4151c8f2c6ff50321fdd5dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-31T20:40:18Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-31T20:40:18Z","email":"raniabusultan@gmail.com","name":"Rani Abu Sultan"},"message":"feat: Implement routing and asset detail page\n\n- Installed and configured vue-router to handle application navigation.\n- Created DashboardView to display the list of assets and DetailView for single asset details.\n- Implemented API call in DetailView to fetch data based on the route parameter.\n- The AssetCard component now uses RouterLink to navigate to the detail page for each asset.","tree":{"sha":"5067e2d9ba9badfc4d3ebb4f10471447c15023c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/trees/5067e2d9ba9badfc4d3ebb4f10471447c15023c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ranibb/market-watch/git/commits/7434b2177056cb2da4151c8f2c6ff50321fdd5dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26841907?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ranibb","id":26841907,"login":"ranibb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODQxOTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranibb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"ht