","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-28T14:43:52Z","email":"kiro@adxcore.com","name":"Kiro AI Assistant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-28T14:43:52Z","email":"kiro@adxcore.com","name":"Kiro AI Assistant"},"message":"feat: Complete Task 44 Production Deployment and Monitoring\n\n✅ Task Status Update:\n- Task 44: Production Deployment and Monitoring marked as COMPLETED\n- Phase 12 (Final Integration and Production Launch) progress\n\n🏗️ Production Infrastructure Implemented:\n- Comprehensive deployment automation (deploy.sh)\n- Disaster recovery and backup procedures (disaster-recovery.sh)\n- Complete monitoring stack (Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Alertmanager)\n- Production-ready Docker Compose configuration\n- Nginx reverse proxy with SSL and load balancing\n- Automated monitoring setup and configuration\n\n📊 Architecture Compliance:\n- ✅ Temporal-first deployment workflows\n- ✅ Multi-tenant production isolation\n- ✅ Microservices independent scaling\n- ✅ Frontend microservices deployment\n- ✅ DevOps operational excellence\n\n🔧 GitHub Sync Infrastructure:\n- Enhanced task analysis and sync capabilities\n- Automated GitHub issue management\n- Comprehensive sync reporting and analysis\n- Production-ready sync tools and scripts\n\n📋 Deliverables:\n- Production deployment scripts and configurations\n- Monitoring and alerting infrastructure\n- Disaster recovery procedures\n- Operational runbooks and documentation\n- Security audit and penetration testing setup\n- Independent service scaling configuration\n\nThis completion establishes production-ready infrastructure supporting\nADX Core''s Temporal-first, multi-tenant, microservices architecture.","tree":{"sha":"916705bdd660dd43275a56f55d357965336f58b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hscale/adx-core-k/git/trees/916705bdd660dd43275a56f55d357965336f58b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hscale/adx-core-k/git/commits/683dec7ebc233c685f97166a135032d5668070c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"